  "what": "Dub techno into progressive house, F minor, 124 BPM. Shows PT/FM's effects: dub chords into a ping-pong DELAY, DUCK pumping them from the kick, the FILTER and GATE turned by commands, the punch-ins one at a time (ECHO THROW, LOOP, REVERB SWELL, TAPE STOP, BIT CRUSH, REVERSE, STUTTER), a 303 bubbling, the VOICES; a cut ending, a VINYL STOP on the full beat",
